# Build output & caches (root-anchored so feature dirs like src/app/features/public are NOT ignored)
/dist
/.angular
/coverage
/out-tsc

# Dependencies & lockfiles
/node_modules
/package-lock.json

# Vendored design reference kit (not application code)
/design-reference

# Static assets
/public
/src/assets

# Tooling / machine-managed files — not application source, and must not be rewritten:
#   - Blueframe state is machine-managed (protocol requires minimal diffs / preserved key order)
#   - CLAUDE.md contains managed markers that must not be reformatted
#   - .claude/ holds agent commands & vendored skills, not team-maintained source
#   - .design-sync/ holds the /design-sync inputs for the design-reference kit
#     (which is itself ignored above). Reformatting is not merely pointless here,
#     it is destructive: the uploaded _ds_sync.json anchors content hashes of
#     previews/*.tsx, so rewriting them invalidates all 17 verified previews and
#     forces a full re-capture and re-grade on the next sync. fonts/ is vendored
#     Google Fonts output.
/.blueframe
/.claude
/CLAUDE.md
/.design-sync
